    "example": "<section data-ds=\"natural-hero\" class=\"section natural-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"nh-title\"><div class=\"section__inner\"><div class=\"natural-hero__grid\"><div class=\"natural-hero__content\"><span class=\"badge badge--neutral\">New improved formula</span><h1 class=\"natural-hero__title\" id=\"nh-title\">100% natural. We cut the bullsh*t.</h1><p class=\"natural-hero__text\">We rebuilt our recipe from scratch: same great taste, only ingredients you can actually recognize.</p><ul class=\"natural-hero__chips\"><li class=\"chip\">Ready in 3'</li><li class=\"chip\">Real flavour</li><li class=\"chip\">Full ingredient transparency</li></ul></div><figure class=\"natural-hero__media\"><img class=\"natural-hero__image\" src=\"../assets/images/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"Noodle packshot and its ingredients\"></figure></div></div></section>",
